#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "AI Act Image Labels"
msgstr "AI Act Image Labels"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "Marks AI-generated and AI-modified media as the EU AI Act asks – right in the media library, with the EU's official icons on the site, and an assistant that finds what needs a label."
msgstr "Marks AI-generated and AI-modified media as the EU AI Act asks – right in the media library, with the EU's official icons on the site, and an assistant that finds what needs a label."

